                "textId": "Performance_809001_36294_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "<style=Highlight>阿奇宝</style>是奥陌陌的伙伴，\n喜欢各种各样有活力的东西，\n活力对它们来说，是美味。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_809001_36294_content",
                "value": "<style=Highlight>阿奇宝</style>是奥陌陌的伙伴，\n喜欢各种各样有活力的东西，\n活力对它们来说，是美味。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 36294
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_809001_36295_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "所以你可以经常在生活中，\n遇见它们蹦出来。\n据学社研究——",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_809001_36295_content",
                "value": "所以你可以经常在生活中，\n遇见它们蹦出来。\n据学社研究——",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 36295
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_809001_36296_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "“<style=Highlight>白色阿奇宝</style>”，是杂食性的。\n什么活力都喜欢，也最常见。\n你所有的生活行为，都有几率遇见它们。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_809001_36296_content",
                "value": "“<style=Highlight>白色阿奇宝</style>”，是杂食性的。\n什么活力都喜欢，也最常见。\n你所有的生活行为，都有几率遇见它们。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 36296
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_809001_36297_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "“<style=Highlight>红色阿奇宝</style>”，是岩食性的。\n你在敲矿、挖掘、采摘蘑菇时，\n比较容易遇见它们。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_809001_36297_content",
                "value": "“<style=Highlight>红色阿奇宝</style>”，是岩食性的。\n你在敲矿、挖掘、采摘蘑菇时，\n比较容易遇见它们。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 36297
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_809001_36298_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "“<style=Highlight>蓝色阿奇宝</style>”，是水食性的。\n你在钓鱼、赶海、浇水、施肥时，\n比较容易遇见它们。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_809001_36298_content",
                "value": "“<style=Highlight>蓝色阿奇宝</style>”，是水食性的。\n你在钓鱼、赶海、浇水、施肥时，\n比较容易遇见它们。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 36298
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_809001_36299_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "“<style=Highlight>绿色阿奇宝</style>”，是素食性的。\n你在摇树、捕虫、种植、采摘收获作物时，\n比较容易遇见它们。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_809001_36299_content",
                "value": "“<style=Highlight>绿色阿奇宝</style>”，是素食性的。\n你在摇树、捕虫、种植、采摘收获作物时，\n比较容易遇见它们。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 36299
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_809001_36300_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "“<style=Highlight>黄色阿奇宝</style>”，是工食性的。\n你在烹饪、创想制作、伐木时，\n比较容易遇见它们。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_809001_36300_content",
                "value": "“<style=Highlight>黄色阿奇宝</style>”，是工食性的。\n你在烹饪、创想制作、伐木时，\n比较容易遇见它们。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
